{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"ca3b53e3","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.003977,"end_time":"2026-11-25T17:54:43.213746+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T17:54:43.209769+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# RAG Pipeline with a Vector Database (ChromaDB)\n","**AIML506 · Department of Computer Science and Engineering · East West University . Fall 2026**  \n","\n","### Project: GridTrace — An Explainable Smart-Grid Transaction Investigation Assistant\n","* **Dataset:** *Smart Grid Blockchain Transaction Dataset* (Mendeley Data DOI: [10.17632/w59j6hyc25.1](https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/w59j6hyc25/1), CC BY 4.0)\n","* **Vector Database:** ChromaDB (Persisted to `/kaggle/working/chroma_db`)\n","* **Embedding Model:** `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` (Dense cosine embeddings)\n","* **Primary Generator:** `Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507` (4-bit NF4 quantized via `bitsandbytes` on GPU)\n","* **Model Ablation:** `Qwen3-8B` (Tested under identical context budget, prompt, and benchmark questions)\n","\n","`CSV Records → Cleaning & Serialization → Document Chunks → ChromaDB (HNSW Cosine) → Top-k Dense Retrieval → Qwen3-4B / Qwen3-8B → Cited JSON Claims`\n","\n","---\n","### Setup Instructions for Kaggle\n","1. **Accelerator:** Under **Notebook Options** (right pane), set **Accelerator** to **GPU T4** or **GPU T4 x 2**.\n","2. **Internet:** Set **Internet** to **On** (required for pip packages and downloading Hugging Face model weights).\n","3. **Dataset:** Attach the dataset `Smart Grid Blockchain Transaction Dataset` via **Add Input -> Datasets** or upload `blockchain_transactions.csv`.\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"f9045e9a","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.00288,"end_time":"2026-11-25T17:54:43.220009+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T17:54:43.217129+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## Background: Variations of Vector-Database RAG\n","Following the taxonomy of Gao et al. (2023), RAG systems are grouped into three paradigms:\n","\n","| Stage | Core Idea | Pipeline |\n","| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n","| **Naive RAG** | Index once, retrieve top-$k$ by similarity, generate answer | `chunk → embed → top-k → generate` |\n","| **Advanced RAG** | Pre-retrieval query expansion, hybrid search, cross-encoder reranking | `rewrite → retrieve → rerank → generate` |\n","| **Modular / Agentic RAG** | Dynamic routing, multi-hop sub-query decomposition, self-critique | `plan → retrieve → verify → generate` |\n","\n","This notebook implements an **Advanced Naive RAG** baseline with:\n","1. **Relational Document Serialization:** Structuring tabular blockchain rows into coherent natural-language documents with rich metadata.\n","2. **HNSW Cosine Indexing:** Fast approximate nearest neighbor search via ChromaDB.\n","3. **Strict Citation Validation:** Rejecting any hallucinated claims whose citations do not match retrieved source IDs.\n","4. **Unified Pipeline Alignment:** Using the exact same generator model, prompt template, context budget, and benchmark questions as the companion GraphRAG notebook.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"id":"b141584e","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-25T17:54:43.227455Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-25T17:54:43.226769Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-25T17:55:03.661508Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-25T17:55:03.660612Z"},"papermill":{"duration":20.440346,"end_time":"2026-11-25T17:55:03.663162+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T17:54:43.222816+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["\u001b[31mERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\r\n","tweepy 4.17.0 requires oauthlib<4,>=3.2.0, but you have oauthlib 4.0.1 which is incompatible.\r\n","gradio 6.30.0 requires pillow<13.0,>=8.0, but you have pillow 13.